<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">precision-disarm-kit</ansi> (jewelcrafting recipe)

An expertly assembled disarm kit with jeweler-grade precision tools.
Each instrument is perfectly calibrated for maximum sensitivity to trap
mechanism resistance, allowing the master craftsman to navigate even
the most elaborate trigger systems with confidence.

